notes.content:
[b]What's new?[/b]
- more deranged people in streets and tweaked their palette to give them a more sinister look;
- turned a bug involving Mary on the roof into a cool feature;
- added scream when the player is killed;
- changed flames' sprite with a better looking one;
- added "I was dreaming" message in Leonard's office.

[i]And the rain sets in,
It's the angel-man,
I'm deranged,
Cruise me, cruise me, cruise me, babe...[/i]
